        "original_id": "e8dd3ad1-81fb-5d33-afa7-7fcd1676dc04",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jerry Schumacher, Shalane Flanagan, Simon Bairu, Chris Solinsky, Matt Tegenkamp, Lisa Koll, Evan Jager\n- Organizations: Bowerman Track Club, Nike\n- Roles: coach, sponsored athlete\n- Records and Achievements: Olympic medal, national 10,000 m records, two mile record, NCAA 10,000 m record, marathon placing\n\nFacts:\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Shalane Flanagan, who won the 2008 Olympic 10,000 m bronze medal, later upgraded to silver.\n- Shalane Flanagan won a bronze medal at the 2011 IAAF World Cross Country Championships.\n- Shalane Flanagan finished second at the 2010 New York City Marathon.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Simon Bairu, the former Canadian 10,000 m record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Chris Solinsky, the former American men's 10,000 m record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Matt Tegenkamp, the American men's two mile record holder.\n- Jerry Schumacher has coached Lisa Koll, the women's NCAA 10,000 m record holder.\n- Evan Jager is sponsored by Nike.\n- Evan Jager is coached by Jerry Schumacher in the Bowerman Track Club.",
